1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
I can’t tell my family what I want without feeling ungrateful.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,800
Private reflection you can correct before exploring peer experiences.

3
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:15,360
Planned AI organizes themes; peer stories are optional.

4
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:17,800
Prepared preview. No model.

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,100
A local example offers a possibility, not an answer.

6
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:24,600
Arjun says, Not quite.

7
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:28,900
He changes the words: it is his parents, and he wants time.

8
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,400
Now the editable reflection changes with what he said.

9
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:36,650
He wants time to decide, without advice to stay or leave.

10
00:00:38,350 --> 00:00:41,775
Day four: one member wants time to choose.

11
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:46,200
Day nine. The host says, I can listen; I can’t decide for you.

12
00:00:46,300 --> 00:00:50,300
Fictional historical examples, prepared and not live.

13
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:53,610
Group only; no private messages.

14
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:56,890
The alias and group audience stay visible.

15
00:00:56,900 --> 00:01:00,560
Private conversation and context are excluded.

16
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:04,600
Consent is unchecked. Continue stays disabled.

17
00:01:04,700 --> 00:01:07,400
Nothing is sent from this preview.

18
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:10,610
No provider is verified or bookable here.

19
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:13,690
He keeps time to decide privately.

20
00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:16,850
He could leave without sharing anything.

21
00:01:16,900 --> 00:01:20,010
Maybe later keeps that choice open.

22
00:01:20,100 --> 00:01:23,480
Private reflection stays out of the group draft.

23
00:01:23,600 --> 00:01:26,905
Arjun keeps the next step in his hands.

24
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:30,980
Nothing is sent without consent. Arjun can leave it here.

